[h1]v0.2.3 - The info panel with Clean UI 2.0 (Rax's Reborn)[/h1]

[h2]What you need to do[/h2]
[list]
[*]Nothing. This is a Lua-only fix: Steam updates the mod, and manual installs do not need to copy anything again.
[/list]

[h2]Changes[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]The vehicle info panel now shows on the Vehicle Mechanics window of Clean UI 2.0 - Rax's Reborn[/b] (and on any other mod's window built on the vanilla one). That mod opens its own mechanics window, and BVD only knew the vanilla one, so the panel never appeared. It does now: grips, tire type, engine force, launch limit, cargo load and load penalty beside the window.
[/list]

Thanks to the player who reported it. If the panel is still missing for you with a different UI mod, tell me which one.
